olin</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Guillerez</surname><given-names>M. -G.</given-names></name><name><surname>Thieriet</surname><given-names>N.</given-names></name><name><surname>Guib&#x000e9;</surname><given-names>F.</given-names></name><name><surname>Loffet</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name></person-group><source>Tetrahedron Lett.</source><year>1995</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>5741</fpage><lpage>5744</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="cit26"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Coste</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Le Nguyen</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Castro</surname><given-names>B.</given-names></name></person-group><source>Tetrahedron Lett.</source><year>1990</year><volume>31</volume><fpage>205</fpage><lpage>208</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="cit27"><element-citation publication-type="journal" id="cit27a"><label> (a) </label><person-group><name><surname>Mergler</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Dick</surname><given-names>F.</given-names></name></person-group><source>J. Peptide Sci.</source><year>2005</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>650</fpage><lpage>657</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15849777</pub-id></element-citation><mixed-citation publication-type="journal" id="cit27b"><label> (b) </label>Formation of aspartimides with &#x003b2;-Asp peptides:<person-group><name><surname>Handa</surname><given-names>B. K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hassall</surname><given-names>C. H.</given-names></name></person-group>, <source>J. Chem. Soc. Perkin Trans 1</source>, <year>1976</year>, <fpage>2014</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>2019</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="cit28"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal">When the synthesis was conducted <italic>via</italic> side-chain anchoring of Asp to <italic>p</italic>-alkoxybenzyl alcohol (Wang) resin (see <person-group><name><surname>Tulla-Puche</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Barany</surname><given-names>G.</given-names></name></person-group>, <source>J. Org. Chem.</source>, <year>2004</year>, <volume>69</volume>, <fpage>4101</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>4107</lpage>, ), treatment with DBU was found to result in complete elimination of cyclised material from the solid support.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15176835</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="cit29"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Nakayama</surname><given-names>Y.</given-names></name><name><surname>Sanemitsu</surname><given-names>Y.</given-names></name></person-group><source>J. Heterocycl. Chem.</source><year>1984</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>1553</fpage><lpage>1556</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="cit30"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Dini</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Drochon</surname><given-names>N.</given-names></name><name><surname>Feteneau</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Guillot</surname><given-names>J. C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Peixoto</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Aszodi</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name></person-group><source>Bioorg. Med. Chem. Lett.</source><year>2001</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>529</fpage><lpage>531</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11229763</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="cit31"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Nicolas</surname><given-names>E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Pedroso</surname><given-names>E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Giralt</surname><given-names>E.</given-names></name></person-group><source>Tetrahedron Lett.</source><year>1989</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>497</fpage><lpage>500</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="cit32"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Naharis